</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"01fdca00-fd34-402c-a781-1e63460e4e6d">
<td data-local-id=3D"93979323-0cf7-4287-bb9d-7a8b6ec1e10e" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3297e24fead4"><strong>Que sont les niveaux d=E2=80=99int=C3=
=A9gration ?</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b538a9a7-ca48-47de-884a-d1745f837bfe" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"63c27ec5952b">Le p=C3=A9rim=C3=A8tre assembl=C3=A9 du syst=
=C3=A8me qu=E2=80=99on valide : small, medium, large.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"779e9e19-7ef0-4aaa-a904-aa32b53a73f3">
<td data-local-id=3D"1d4d1997-ed2d-4a80-8bc6-a49a8919d580" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7ee1ac4ad16b"><strong>Que sont les types de test ?</strong><=
/p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a2bf310a-194f-407f-8aeb-332db48bb57d" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8218784d6d5b">L=E2=80=99angle de qualit=C3=A9 ou de risque q=
u=E2=80=99on cherche =C3=A0 valider : fonctionnel, s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9, perf=
ormance, r=C3=A9silience, etc.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"936a07d4-b83f-43a0-b287-5265028f3c3a">
<td data-local-id=3D"b19552ad-506b-4311-89d2-64d2edb3bd45" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"da184cda68f8"><strong>Que sont white-box, gray-box, black-bo=
x ?</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dce5b3c4-bd26-43ed-97ad-91f1df7b49ae" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ced269110193">Des approches d=E2=80=99observation applicable=
s =C3=A0 n=E2=80=99importe quel niveau.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7a791c2a-c169-4256-91ee-e33340aaeb83">
<td data-local-id=3D"19dafb8a-6ffa-4444-9395-a839fab2e7e5" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4939c717ae17"><strong>Peut-on faire de la performance ou de =
la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 en small ?</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bae26848-a515-411d-889f-7ae0c1b21e8d" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a171be9d2576">Oui. Ces types de validation peuvent exister =
=C3=A0 tous les niveaux.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3d31bade-fd0b-4368-a259-e0417f0dbf56">
<td data-local-id=3D"eb95ef72-5246-4053-ac72-3692f5df5923" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"42e303112004"><strong>La pyramide de tests d=C3=A9finit-elle=
 ces niveaux ?</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c9494cff-1788-4184-827c-bacdabfd78b6" valign=3D"top" c=
lass=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ae40e8b1fc8">Non. Elle peut aider =C3=A0 parler d=E2=80=99a=
utomatisation, mais elle ne d=C3=A9finit pas les niveaux d=E2=80=99int=C3=
=A9gration.</p></td>
